concept:telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2009-sch-1-sec-275b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "275B Emergency management person"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-275b ;
    values:originalText "(1) In this Part: emergency management person means a person who holds, occupies or performs the duties of an office or position specified under subsection (2).  (2) The Minister administering the Administrative Decisions (Judicial Review) Act 1977 may, by legislative instrument, specify either or both of the following for the purposes of the definition of emergency management person in subsection (1) of this section:  (a) offices;  (b) positions.  (3) Offices or positions established by or under a law of a State or Territory may be specified under subsection (2).  (4) Subsection (3) does not limit subsection (2).  (5) Before making an instrument under subsection (2), the Minister administering the Administrative Decisions (Judicial Review) Act 1977 must consult the Minister administering this Act." ;
    skos:definition "(1) In this Part: emergency management person means a person who holds, occupies or performs the duties of an office or position specified under subsection (2).  (2) The Minister administering the Administrative Decisions (Judicial Review) Act 1977 may, by legislative instrument, specify either or both of the following for the purposes of the definition of emergency management person in subsection (1) of this section:  (a) offices;  (b) positions.  (3) Offices or positions established by or under a law of a State or Territory may be specified under subsection (2).  (4) Subsection (3) does not limit subsection (2).  (5) Before making an instrument under subsection (2), the Minister administering the Administrative Decisions (Judicial Review) Act 1977 must consult the Minister administering this Act."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "bb14a11a1fb3f2d28769cb91faee3646f319e69debaf071669ad53283f80abb6" ;
    cof:pageNumber "7"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-amendment-integrated-public-number-database-act-2009-sch-1-sec-275b-ss-1 ;
